title    Insert Coin
composer Claude (ShooterCoaster)
about    Title theme option "fanfare": a heroic D major brass fanfare with orchestra hits, timpani and a galloping FM bass over a march beat. Bar 25 lifts a tone, to E major, under a supersaw descant, and the last four bars cadence home.
tempo    172
beats    4
steps    2
reverb   0.26

voice lead    brass     vol=0.8
voice counter supersaw  vol=0.3  pan=0.2
voice pad     strings   vol=0.2  pan=-0.3 center=F#4
voice bass    fmbass    vol=0.52  gate=0.65
voice timp    timpani   vol=0.42 pan=-0.15
voice hit     orchhit   vol=0.45
voice kick    bigkick   vol=0.6
voice snare   gatesnare vol=0.55
voice roll    snare     vol=0.22 pan=0.25
voice hat     hat909    vol=0.24 pan=0.3
voice crash   crash     vol=0.3  pan=-0.2

pattern intro
timp  | D2 . D2 . D2 D2 D2 D2 | C3 C3 B2 B2 A2 A2 A2! A2! |
hit   | [D]! . [D]! . [D]!--- | [C]!- [G/B]!- [A]!--- |
snare | .... .... | xxxx XXXX |
crash | X... .... | .... X... |

pattern A1
lead  | D5 . A4 D5 F#5- E5 D5 | E5--- C#5- A4- | B4 . F#5 B4 D5- C#5 B4 | G5--- F#5- E5- |
pad   | [D]?------- | [A/C#]?------- | [Bm]?------- | [G]?------- |
bass  | D2- D2 D2 A2- A2 A2 | C#2- C#2 C#2 E3- E3 E3 | B2- B2 B2 F#3- F#3 F#3 | G2- G2 G2 D3- D3 D3 |
timp  | D2 . . . A2 . . . | C#3 . . . E3 . . . | B2 . . . F#3 . . . | G2 . . . D3 . . . |
hit   | [D] .------ | _ | [Bm] .------ | _ |
kick  | x... x... | % | % | x... x.x. |
snare | ..x. ..x. | % | % | % |
hat   | xxxx xxxx | % | % | % |
crash | X... .... | _ | _ | _ |

pattern A2
